{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"ad72350b-6d69-49f3-bc6d-53f5b0778034","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the analytics events defined in **docs/EVENTS.md** for both registration and offers screens.\n\n**Key changes**\n- Added analytics flags and captured events (`registration_email_started`, `registration_phone_started`, `loan_amount_changed`, `terms_accepted`) in `registration_screen.dart`.\n- Updated slider handling to fire `loan_amount_changed` on `onChangeEnd`.\n- Added scroll tracking for offers list using `ScrollEndNotification` to fire `offers_scrolled` with offset.\n- Imported shared `Analytics` wrapper and ensured events fire only once per screen visit.\n\n**Applied parts from colleague’s note**\n- Used once‑only flags for text fields.\n- Moved slider event to `onChangeEnd`.\n- Used `ScrollEndNotification` for scroll events.\n- Preserved event names and properties as specified.  \n\nSee **ANSWER.md** for a full summary of modifications.\n","duration_seconds":284.230399,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":45495,"output_tokens":25353,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":1007232,"total_tokens":70848}}}
